OL,3,GNEWSAUK faces worst decade for
OL,4,Ahousehold incomes, IFS think tank says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile PM Andy Burnham says the
OL,7,Fgovernment wants to get the welfare
OL,8,Fbill down "as quickly as possible" -
OL,9,Fearlier Downing Street said it is not
OL,10,Fsetting a "target or timetable" for
OL,11,Fwhen welfare spending will fall
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey delivered his
OL,14,Ffirst Budget as chancellor on Wednesday
OL,15,F- here's a quick guide to what was
OL,16,Fannounced
OL,18,FThe Conservatives have criticised the
OL,19,Fchancellor's "disjointed" Budget, while
OL,20,Fthe Lib Dems say we need closer ties
OL,21,Fwith Europe "so we can grow and
OL,22,Ftherefore cut people's taxes"
